*MaxMediaWidth: "307"
*MaxMediaHeight: "1080"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 10 307
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 10 1080
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorSpace 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *zeMediaTracking/Media Tracking: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *zeMediaTracking
*DefaultzeMediaTracking: Web
*zeMediaTracking Web/Gap Sensing: ""
*zeMediaTracking Mark/Black Mark: ""
*zeMediaTracking Continuous/Continuous: ""
*CloseUI: *zeMediaTracking

*OpenUI *GapHeight/Gap or Mark Height: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *GapHeight
*DefaultGapHeight: 3
*GapHeight 2/2 mm: ""
*GapHeight 3/3 mm: ""
*GapHeight 4/4 mm: ""
*GapHeight 5/5 mm: ""
*GapHeight 6/6 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *GapHeight

*OpenUI *GapOffset/Gap or Mark Offset: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *GapOffset
*DefaultGapOffset: 0
*GapOffset 0/0 mm: ""
*GapOffset 1/1 mm: ""
*GapOffset 2/2 mm: ""
*GapOffset 3/3 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *GapOffset

*OpenUI *Darkness/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: 8
*Darkness PrinterDefault/Printer default (no DENSITY sent): ""
*Darkness 1/1 (Lightest): ""
*Darkness 2/2: ""
*Darkness 3/3: ""
*Darkness 4/4: ""
*Darkness 5/5: ""
*Darkness 6/6: ""
*Darkness 7/7: ""
*Darkness 8/8 (Default): ""
*Darkness 9/9: ""
*Darkness 10/10: ""
*Darkness 11/11: ""
*Darkness 12/12: ""
*Darkness 13/13: ""
*Darkness 14/14: ""
*Darkness 15/15 (Darkest): ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*OpenUI *zePrintRate/Print Speed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *zePrintRate
*DefaultzePrintRate: 4
*zePrintRate 2/2 ips: ""
*zePrintRate 3/3 ips: ""
*zePrintRate 4/4 ips (Default): ""
*zePrintRate 5/5 ips: ""
*zePrintRate 6/6 ips: ""
*CloseUI: *zePrintRate

*% Rendering mode. GrayScale = vendor Bayer 8x8 ordered dither: best for
*% photos AND compresses far better than error diffusion (matters over
*% Bluetooth - the printer chokes on large compressed streams).
*OpenUI *ColorOption/Rendering: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorOption
*DefaultColorOption: GrayScale
*ColorOption GrayScale/Grayscale (ordered dither): ""
*ColorOption None/Black and white (threshold): ""
*ColorOption FloydSteinberg/Floyd-Steinberg (small labels only): ""
*CloseUI: *ColorOption

*OpenUI *DegreeOfGrayRecognition/Gray Recognition (GrayScale): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *DegreeOfGrayRecognition
*DefaultDegreeOfGrayRecognition: 4
*DegreeOfGrayRecognition 1/1 (most black): ""
*DegreeOfGrayRecognition 2/2: ""
*DegreeOfGrayRecognition 3/3: ""
*DegreeOfGrayRecognition 4/4 (Default): ""
*DegreeOfGrayRecognition 5/5: ""
*DegreeOfGrayRecognition 6/6: ""
*DegreeOfGrayRecognition 7/7 (least black): ""
*CloseUI: *DegreeOfGrayRecognition

*OpenUI *BlackLevel/Threshold Level (B and W): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BlackLevel
*DefaultBlackLevel: 2
*BlackLevel 1/1 (192 - most black): ""
*BlackLevel 2/2 (160 - Default): ""
*BlackLevel 3/3 (144): ""
*BlackLevel 4/4 (128): ""
*BlackLevel 5/5 (112): ""
*BlackLevel 6/6 (96): ""
*BlackLevel 7/7 (64): ""
*BlackLevel 8/8 (0 - least black): ""
*CloseUI: *BlackLevel

*OpenUI *Rotate/Rotate 180: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 160 AnySetup *Rotate
*DefaultRotate: 0
*Rotate 0/Off: ""
*Rotate 180/On: ""
*CloseUI: *Rotate

*% After PRINT, poll SSSGETPRINTING over the back channel until the
*% printer reports :DONE (keeps the Bluetooth link open while printing;
*% also surfaces the 7E 01/00 7E job ACK/NACK in the job log).
*OpenUI *WaitForCompletion/Wait for print completion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 200 AnySetup *WaitForCompletion
*DefaultWaitForCompletion: 60
*WaitForCompletion 0/Off: ""
*WaitForCompletion 15/15 s: ""
*WaitForCompletion 60/60 s: ""
*WaitForCompletion 180/180 s: ""
*CloseUI: *WaitForCompletion

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*% End of D450BT.ppd
